WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,340
Then we can only work hard

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,780
Then Lin Dong won't let us live anymore

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,220
Then why are we afraid of not working hard?

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,220
Are you really waiting to starve to death here?

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,260
It's easy for you to say, that guy Lin Dong

6
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,420
demonstrated combat effectiveness

7
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:15,710
If we try our best, we will die, you think?

8
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,900
Lin Dong is so awesome

9
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,640
Why are you still stuck in the community without going out?

10
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,440
Because of the poisonous cave outside

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,970
It seems you are not too stupid.

12
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:28,050
The biggest difference between humans and animals is that

13
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,090
People can use tools and external forces

14
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:33,830
We definitely won't be able to defeat us with a strong frontal attack. I suggest

15
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,590
Let's send a few people for protection

16
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,950
Get some blood in advance and secretly take it to find Lin Dong.

17
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:39,910
Just get the blood on Lin Dong

18
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:41,470
Then he will die

19
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,260
Makes sense

20
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,540
We have been worried about poisonous blood all day long

21
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:49,100
We actually forgot that this can also be our weapon, so we just did it like this

22
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:53,660
I'll send someone to track down the blood right now. Be careful at three o'clock in the morning.

23
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,340
It’s when people sleep the deepest

24
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,700
Take action then
